[0.000, "o", "\r\nphase breakdown (98s wall, 98s measured)\r\n  phase        calls  seconds  share    mean  tokens\r\n  survey           1      0.0    0%     0.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  recall           1      0.0    0%     0.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  loop_model       6     41.6   43%     6.9  in 12 out 3,532 cached 84,931\r\n  loop_tools       5      0.1    0%     0.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  draft            1     37.0   38%    37.0  in 19,668 out 4,070\r\n  gate             1      0.0    0%     0.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  verify           1     18.8   19%    18.8  in 17,412 out 934\r\n  sufficiency      1      0.0    0%     0.0  in 0 out 0\r\n  cache hit rate: 70%\r\n\r\nWHAT THE DATA ACTUALLY CONTAINED\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  correct verdict: NAME THE CAUSE\r\n  planted cause: Nine accounts closed won last quarter. Only three of them -- Globex, Hooli and Wonka Industries -- have produced a single product event since. The other six, carrying $810,000 of the $1,230,000 closed, have never appeared in the product at all."]
